  "fullDescription": "This Cute Forest Farm Animals Group Clipart Bundle PNG features adorable kawaii-style baby woodland and farm animals arranged in charming group poses. Each design is delivered as a high-resolution transparent PNG, making these files sublimation-ready and ideal for print on demand and digital crafting projects.\n\nThe bundle includes a variety of sweet animal combinations such as puppies, bunnies, foxes, raccoons, bears, kittens, ducklings, lambs, piglets, hedgehogs, hamsters, and squirrels. The soft shading, expressive faces, and warm earthy tones create a playful, nursery-friendly aesthetic perfect for kids-focused designs.\n\nThese transparent PNG files are easy to drag and drop onto t-shirts, mugs, stickers, tote bags, wall art, and more. Clean edges and print-ready quality save you time while helping you create standout handmade gifts, baby shower decor, classroom materials, and seasonal craft projects.\n\nWhat’s inside?\n\n– High-resolution PNG files ( 4500px + ) with transparent backgrounds\n– Transparent backgrounds: Seamlessly integrate these clipart into any project without unwanted borders.\n\nBest Use Cases\n\n– Kids t-shirt designs\n– Baby bodysuits and onesies\n– Nursery wall art prints\n– Stickers and planner decals\n– Sublimation mugs and tumblers\n– Tote bag graphics\n– Birthday party invitations\n– Classroom reward charts\n– Scrapbooking embellishments\n– Digital planner stickers\n\nPerfect for Projects\n\n– Baby shower decorations\n– First birthday shirts\n– Woodland theme parties\n– Farm theme birthdays\n– Nursery name signs\n– Preschool classroom decor\n– Easter craft projects\n– Holiday gift tags\n– DIY baby milestone cards\n– Kids room wall prints",
